WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.340
54th Fujigaya's School Play - Wuthering Heights
- by the High School Drama Club

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.360
Wow, what's that?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.360
A poster for the Drama Club. Nice, ain't it?

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.120
Isn't it a little... powerful?

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.600
No way. It's so cool.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.130
What are your thoughts on
this, Catherine-sempai?

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:25.200
Sugimoto really is good-looking, so that's
OK, but I don't deserve this treatment...

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.330
There you have it. A word from
the actress in the poster.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.920
But you really are beautiful,
Kawasaki-sempai.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.750
Oh, stop that.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.800
I wonder if I can take it home
when the show is over.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.310
I want to hang it up in my room.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.970
Maybe it's a little low.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.820
Yeah...

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:51.980
Tape, please.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.180
Ah, the rehearsal is going to start.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.150
Let's finish this quickly.

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.760
Did you see that crazy poster?

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.000
Yes, I think it's wonderful.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.350
You really think so?

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.290
Sugimoto-sempai!

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.490
Did you like the poster?

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:49.060
Yeah, I feel bad that you
put so much work into it.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.150
Oh no, I wanted to do more...

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.010
Hmm?

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:55.520
Umm...

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:59.030
Break a leg on stage.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.190
Thank you.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.190
I talked to her!

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:14.650
What did you talk about?

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.020
I'm not telling!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.800
Keep it with the group!

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.160
Sempai...

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:27.810
You're liked by everyone, aren't you?

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.270
What? You jealous?

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.500
Maybe I am.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.980
Fumi?

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:55.320
Darn, no good.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.950
I told you we have to get closer.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.390
I find myself doubting her.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:04.390
Huh?

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:12.260
I wonder if she has someone else she likes.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:15.730
That's all I've been able to
think about since then.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:19.860
It gets in the way of our conversations,
when I'm talking to her.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.490
Well, I'm not the best person
to ask about this,

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.990
but they say that people get anxious when
they have feelings for someone...

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.430
Couldn't it be something like that?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.580
Maybe you're right...

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.240
Okudaira-san.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.820
Oh, Ikumi-san.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:41.830
What kind of juice do you want?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.910
Juice?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:46.570
I'm asking everyone. The club president
asked me to go on a juice run.

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:47.650
I'll join you.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.300
Oh, there she is.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.300
Okudaira-san!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.190
Heathcliff's stick, it...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.650
Nuts, they broke it.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.090
Got it. I'll be right there!

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:03.230
Sorry, Ikumi-san.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:04.990
It's no big deal.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.600
So, what do you want?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.180
Orange juice, please.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.070
See you in a bit, Fumi-chan.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.760
Sure. Good luck.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.650
Manjome-san?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.290
Yes?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.180
Would you like something to drink too?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.300
Umm...

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.090
Sorry for asking you to help me.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:37.260
It's OK.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.070
So... is the person you
like Sugimoto-sempai?

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.530
What?

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:55.810
You too, huh?

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:00.130
Sugimoto-sempai is really
something special.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.360
There are lots of girls who like her.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.340
Yeah... I get that vibe.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.180
OK, good work, guys.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.230
Ah, it's over.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.240
Good work.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.140
That last part was just...

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.070
Good work.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.080
Good work.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.470
Good work, guys.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.450
You too!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.030
Good work.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.540
You were awesome!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.900
Thanks. Get home safe.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.340
Did you hear that?

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.320
Not fair!

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:42.800
Here you go.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.330
Oh, Kyoko, you're so thoughtful.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.160
Umm...

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:49.310
Fumi!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.830
All third years gather 'round,
we've got a meeting.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.070
The first and second years can go
home once you finish tidying up.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:02.400
OK!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.930
This is gonna take some time, so you don't
have to wait for me to go home, Fumi.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:06.960
OK.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.070
We're starting, Sugimoto!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.170
Sorry. I'm ready now.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:21.860
OK, start with the lines on page 75...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.560
Fumi-chan!

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.390
Achan.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.510
So you're not going home
with Sempai today.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.330
Yeah. She said she's gonna be late.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:37.140
Say, wanna join us for tea?
Ikumi-san is coming too.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.420
As long as you're both OK with it.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.830
Ikumi-san, can Fumi-chan join us?

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.510
Sure, of course.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:08.490
They're my girls. I take them
all over the place.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.250
Fumi!

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:33.230
Hi, Mom? I'm near Kamakura station.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.940
Yeah, with Achan and another friend.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.520
She's so diligent. She calls
her house to check in.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:42.260
But Fumi-chan really is a good girl.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.330
She truly is.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:50.010
Sempai likes her, doesn't she?

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.200
Huh?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.030
I had

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.310
the wrong idea all along...

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.470
Ikumi-san?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.170
What's wrong? Look at me!

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:24.390
Sugimoto-sempai

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.550
Sugimoto-sempai

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.060
Sugimoto-sempai

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.450
Did I wake you?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:55.850
No...

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.300
It's not a big deal, but...

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.520
Uh-huh...

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:05.490
You didn't say you'd wait
for me, so I got worried.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.290
I'm sorry.

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:13.480
If you have something on
your mind, tell me.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:20.350
Tell me, Fumi. I won't be
able to sleep otherwise.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:26.940
I talked with Kyoko Ikumi-san.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:31.630
She said she liked you and was in tears.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:33.790
I see.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.380
Hey, Fumi.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.440
Yes?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.950
Do you remember your first love?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.070
Huh?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:49.760
Do you remember the first person
you fell in love with?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.830
Fumi-chan!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.350
'Morning.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:57.530
Good morning.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.350
Something good happened to you, didn't it?

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.210
Huh?

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:11.510
Well, Sempai called me yesterday.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:13.260
Oh? That's fantastic!

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:14.270
Yeah.

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.810
Do you remember your first love?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.420
My... first love.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:39.490
The schoolday is over for everyone but
those in the school play and the crew.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.700
I repeat...

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.050
Don't you feel like we're missing something?

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.970
Maybe we should add
some more flowers.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.390
Yeah, that might do it.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.730
Look at them.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.540
What are the elementary schoolers
putting on again?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.290
The Little Prince, wasn't it?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.250
That girl's the Little Prince?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.110
Yup.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.980
The conceited rose?

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.730
That's her, isn't it?

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:10.110
So cute!

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:13.050
Be careful not to bump into anything.

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:14.280
OK.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.120
It's fragile.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.250
Got it.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.650
Oh, they're rehearsing.

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:32.700
Hey, do you know where
Sugimoto-sempai is?

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.900
I doubt she's here yet.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.930
I wonder when we'll get to see her.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:40.310
Well, the elementary school students
do theirs first, so...

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:43.730
Anyway, she's not here yet. See you later!

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.740
There's no need to worry so much.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.700
Farewell.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:59.230
Farewell.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.670
Yes, farewell.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:05.130
I'm fine, really, Okudaira-san.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:08.050
As for the big animals,
I'm not afraid of them.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.960
I have my own claws: thorns.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:15.060
You made up your mind to leave. Now go.

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:18.510
I never imagined that

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:22.850
two people having mutual
feelings for one another

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.000
could make a person sad.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.300
I was a fool.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:47.970
I should never have run away.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:53.340
I ought to have realized

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:58.020
the tenderness underlying
her silly pretensions.

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:04.100
You don't want to go?

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.030
That's right.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:14.450
Well, I don't want to go if you aren't going.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.140
But you're playing the lead, Sempai...

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.930
You think it'll be awkward to see Kyoko?

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:27.210
Yes... I think it'll be awkward.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:31.200
I've been seeing a lot of her lately.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.400
That's because she's been
asking you to come out.

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:37.500
I want to ask you to go out too.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.110
Don't say that to me like that...

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:43.560
You're feeling pity, aren't you, Fumi?

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:52.720
Well, whatever. I'll go by myself today.

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:02.850
This is impressive. Did you
make it yourself, Kyoko?

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:07.220
I couldn't do it by myself.
The others here helped me.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.040
That's really great. Good work, guys.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.520
Oh, nothing of the sort!

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.350
We're just doing our job!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:18.350
What's the matter with you, dummy?

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.430
Sorry! I didn't mean to!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.840
Sempai!

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.850
Do you like sweets?

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.640
We brought you cakes.

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:26.820
If you'd be so kind...

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:27.990
Wow.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.290
Thank you. Since you brought them
to me, how about we share?

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.270
No, that wasn't our intent.

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.120
Sorry, we...

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:38.720
Everyone fawns all over her. I'm sure
Fumi-chan didn't want to see this.

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:42.150
OK, we'll go get some plates and forks.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.530
Great. Thanks.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.400
Ikumi-san...

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.510
Oh, wow, Kyoko. These
are really homemade.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.710
Can you stand for a second, Sempai?

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:04.900
Sorry. Please stand still.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.240
All right.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.370
Achan!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.280
Want some cake, Achan?

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.790
Gladly!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.120
I'm going to tack hem it.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.310
Let me know if it's hard to move anywhere.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.490
I'll put a pot of tea on.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.170
Oh, thanks. I'd normally ask
Fumi, if she were here...

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.830
Come with me, Ikumi-san!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:39.490
Huh?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.170
H-Hey!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.600
Achan sure is full of energy.

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.370
Look at these. They're incredible.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.810
Look at how she has her arms around her.

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.660
Her hands look so scandalous!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.380
Look, look. Isn't that amazing?

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:59.360
I wonder if they'll kiss on stage.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.230
Pardon us.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.590
What was that all about?

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.370
OK, where's the English tea?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:33.310
They make such a racket about it because
they don't really like her.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.490
But I'm different.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.660
Fujigaya Station

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.190
Huh?

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.820
Sorry. I still have something I have to do.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.230
Shall I wait for you?

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:54.050
Thanks, but it's OK.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:10.880
I'm just a fan in the crowd, aren't I?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:15.910
Just like those other girls.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.940
Was that directed at me?

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.780
We're the only two people here.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:26.200
You told me to just treat you
like I always have, Kyoko.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.840
Don't take what I said literally.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.960
I was just trying to act strong.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:38.420
That's just like you to say that.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.120
You're adorable.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.330
Like a little sister, you mean?

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.720
You really have a hard time
getting over things.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.960
But you're a good girl, so I won't
make a big deal about it.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.320
You're cruel.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.680
I'll be all right now.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.330
Fumi-chan!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.550
What is it, Mom?

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.130
Fumi.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.300
Ah, Sempai...

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.370
What is it?

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:16.630
Sorry, I just wanted to see your face.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:20.590
Work the desk?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.800
Yes. At the play.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.890
I already told the club
president you'd do it.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:26.930
Huh?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:30.480
I figured you wouldn't come otherwise.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.150
That's...

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.900
That's not true.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:40.610
Seriously?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.770
So you'll come if I ask you to?

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:43.970
I will.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:45.910
OK.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.590
Umm...

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.060
Hmm?

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:54.710
Good luck.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:57.410
You too.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:00.530
You aren't cold?

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.550
I'm all right.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.060
That's a new outfit, isn't it?

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:09.230
It's cute.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.390
Please don't tease me.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:16.100
Aww, you shoulda told her!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.940
I didn't have an opening.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.970
I was just being jealous.

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:22.020
As you should have! That's how a lady acts!

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:27.600
Anyway, you need to really be straightforward
with a person like her.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.330
Tell her flat out you don't want
others flirting with her!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.780
Huh? Isn't that a bit of
a strange thing to say?

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.040
You think?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:40.130
Still, I'm glad, because I thought you
might end up not going to the play.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.370
Actually, I'm really glad myself.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:46.340
Let's do our best at the play tomorrow.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.070
Yeah. I hope it's a success.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.110
